<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - Boston Chicken cut.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Boston Chicken cut.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-06-02</dateline>
<text>
<p>Alex. Brown said it lowered its rating on Boston Chicken Inc stock to buy from strong buy.</p>
<p>-- Additional details were not immediately available.</p>
<p>-- Last week, Boston Chicken said its sales so far in the second quarter had been flat to slightly negative. The fast-food chain also said it would release details of a restructuring early this week.</p>
<p>-- Shares of Boston Chicken were down 1-1/2 at 16-1/2 early Monday afternoon.</p>
